stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> SpreadSelected : User selects Spread & Persona
    SpreadSelected --> CardSelection : Enter Question (<= 500 chars)

    state CardSelection {
        [*] --> VirtualRitual : Mode A (Shuffle & Draw)
        [*] --> ManualPicker : Mode B (Pick Physical Cards)
        VirtualRitual --> CardsLocked : N cards drawn (Upright/Reversed)
        ManualPicker --> CardsLocked : N cards assigned
    }

    CardsLocked --> QuotaVerification : Submit Session Request
    QuotaVerification --> InsufficientBalance : Free Quota Exceeded & Crystals < Cost
    InsufficientBalance --> QuotaVerification : Top-up Crystals / Upgrade Pro
    QuotaVerification --> AIStreaming : Crystals Deducted / Free Tier Valid

    AIStreaming --> SynthesisCompleted : 4-Part SSE Stream Finished
    SynthesisCompleted --> FollowUpActive : Ask Follow-up (Count <= 3)
    FollowUpActive --> SynthesisCompleted : AI Answer Streamed

    SynthesisCompleted --> ClarifierDrawn : Draw Clarifier Card (Count <= 2)
    ClarifierDrawn --> SynthesisCompleted : Clarifier Synthesis Streamed

    SynthesisCompleted --> JournalSaved : Auto-save to Timeline + User Reflection
    JournalSaved --> ShareCardExported : Render 9:16 or 1:1 Social Card
    ShareCardExported --> [*]
    JournalSaved --> [*]
